---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Air360 | Customer Stories">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl" data-theme="dark">
    <header class="header">
      <p class="header-intro">
        When you build analytics that actually help people understand their users instead of
        drowning them in charts, magical things happen.
      </p>
      <p class="header-intro">We asked our customers:</p>
      <h1>What changed for the better since you switched to Air360?</h1>
    </header>

    <div class="testimonials-grid">
      <div class="testimonial">
        <div class="testimonial-quote">
          Simply put, we <span class="highlight">finally understand our users</span>. No more
          guessing why people bounce. Our conversion rates are up 40% and my CEO actually smiles
          during analytics meetings now.
        </div>
        <div class="testimonial-author">Sarah Mitchell</div>
        <div class="testimonial-company">Growth Hacker at TechFlow</div>
      </div>

      <div class="testimonial">
        <div class="testimonial-quote">
          I went from <span class="highlight">spending 3 hours analyzing funnels to 10 minutes</span
          > getting actual insights. Air360 shows me exactly where users get confused instead of just
          pretty graphs that tell me nothing.
        </div>
        <div class="testimonial-author">Marcus Chen</div>
        <div class="testimonial-company">Product Manager at FinanceApp</div>
      </div>

      <div class="testimonial">
        <div class="testimonial-quote">
          Before Air360, our user research was basically "let's add more pop-ups and see what
          happens." Now we <span class="highlight">actually know what our users are thinking</span> when
          they use our product. Game changer!
        </div>
        <div class="testimonial-author">Jessica Rodriguez</div>
        <div class="testimonial-company">UX Lead at StartupXYZ</div>
      </div>

      <div class="testimonial">
        <div class="testimonial-quote">
          Our A/B tests went from random shots in the dark to <span class="highlight"
            >strategic moves based on real user behavior</span
          >. We've cut our testing time in half while doubling our success rate.
        </div>
        <div class="testimonial-author">David Thompson</div>
        <div class="testimonial-company">Conversion Optimizer at E-comm Plus</div>
      </div>

      <div class="testimonial">
        <div class="testimonial-quote">
          The heatmaps are so detailed I can literally see where users get frustrated and
          rage-click. <span class="highlight">It's like having superpowers for UX</span>. My
          designer friends are jealous of our insights.
        </div>
        <div class="testimonial-author">Amanda Foster</div>
        <div class="testimonial-company">Head of Product at SaaSCorp</div>
      </div>

      <div class="testimonial">
        <div class="testimonial-quote">
          Air360 turned our "why is nobody buying?" meetings into "here's exactly what to fix"
          action plans. <span class="highlight">Revenue is up 60% in 3 months</span>. I should
          probably ask for a raise.
        </div>
        <div class="testimonial-author">Kevin Park</div>
        <div class="testimonial-company">E-commerce Manager at ShopFast</div>
      </div>

      <div class="testimonial">
        <div class="testimonial-quote">
          Finally, analytics that my entire team can actually understand! <span class="highlight"
            >No more "what does this chart mean?"</span
          > questions in every meeting. Everyone's data-driven now.
        </div>
        <div class="testimonial-author">Maria Santos</div>
        <div class="testimonial-company">Marketing Director at GrowthCo</div>
      </div>

      <div class="testimonial">
        <div class="testimonial-quote">
          I used to guess which landing page elements to optimize. Now Air360 <span
            class="highlight">shows me exactly what users love and hate</span
          >. My boss thinks I'm psychic.
        </div>
        <div class="testimonial-author">Ryan O'Connor</div>
        <div class="testimonial-company">CRO Specialist at ConvertMore</div>
      </div>

      <div class="testimonial">
        <div class="testimonial-quote">
          The session recordings are like Netflix for product managers – addictive and full of plot
          twists. <span class="highlight">Watching users navigate our app</span> has taught me more than
          a thousand surveys.
        </div>
        <div class="testimonial-author">Lisa Chang</div>
        <div class="testimonial-company">Product Lead at MobileFirst</div>
      </div>

      <div class="testimonial">
        <div class="testimonial-quote">
          We went from "users are dumb" to "oh wait, our UX is confusing." <span class="highlight"
            >Air360 humbled us in the best way possible</span
          >. Our user satisfaction scores doubled.
        </div>
        <div class="testimonial-author">Michael Barnes</div>
        <div class="testimonial-company">Founder at UserLove</div>
      </div>

      <div class="testimonial">
        <div class="testimonial-quote">
          I discovered our checkout process had 7 different ways to confuse users. <span
            class="highlight">Fixed them all in one week</span
          > and sales immediately jumped. Air360 paid for itself in 3 days.
        </div>
        <div class="testimonial-author">Jennifer Walsh</div>
        <div class="testimonial-company">E-commerce Optimizer at RetailWin</div>
      </div>

      <div class="testimonial">
        <div class="testimonial-quote">
          The rage click detection is pure gold. <span class="highlight"
            >Found 12 broken buttons users were frantically clicking</span
          >. No wonder they were angry! Our support tickets dropped by 40%.
        </div>
        <div class="testimonial-author">Thomas Wright</div>
        <div class="testimonial-company">Customer Success at AppDelight</div>
      </div>

      <div class="testimonial">
        <div class="testimonial-quote">
          Air360's form analytics revealed our sign-up form was a user nightmare. <span
            class="highlight">Redesigned it based on the data and registrations tripled</span
          >. Sometimes the truth hurts, but it helps!
        </div>
        <div class="testimonial-author">Rachel Kim</div>
        <div class="testimonial-company">Growth Lead at SignMeUp</div>
      </div>

      <div class="testimonial">
        <div class="testimonial-quote">
          Mobile heatmaps showed us our "responsive" design was actually responsive chaos. <span
            class="highlight">Fixed the mobile UX and bounce rate plummeted</span
          >. Users can actually use our app on phones now!
        </div>
        <div class="testimonial-author">Carlos Mendez</div>
        <div class="testimonial-company">Mobile Product Manager at AppCo</div>
      </div>

      <div class="testimonial">
        <div class="testimonial-quote">
          The AI insights are scary good. It spotted patterns I would never have found manually. <span
            class="highlight">Feels like having a data scientist with supernatural powers</span
          > on the team.
        </div>
        <div class="testimonial-author">Sophie Anderson</div>
        <div class="testimonial-company">Analytics Manager at DataDriven</div>
      </div>

      <div class="testimonial">
        <div class="testimonial-quote">
          Scroll depth analysis taught us our most important content was hidden below the fold where
          nobody saw it. <span class="highlight">Moved it up, engagement went through the roof</span
          >. Simple but brilliant.
        </div>
        <div class="testimonial-author">Alex Johnson</div>
        <div class="testimonial-company">Content Strategist at EngageCorp</div>
      </div>

      <div class="testimonial">
        <div class="testimonial-quote">
          User journey mapping in Air360 is like GPS for conversion optimization. <span
            class="highlight">No more getting lost in the data maze</span
          >. We know exactly where users drop off and why.
        </div>
        <div class="testimonial-author">Emily Turner</div>
        <div class="testimonial-company">Conversion Expert at PathFinder</div>
      </div>

      <div class="testimonial">
        <div class="testimonial-quote">
          I thought our homepage was perfect. Air360 showed me 8 different ways it was confusing
          users. <span class="highlight">Humbling experience, amazing results</span>. Homepage
          conversions doubled overnight.
        </div>
        <div class="testimonial-author">Jake Williams</div>
        <div class="testimonial-company">Marketing Manager at HomepageHero</div>
      </div>

      <div class="testimonial">
        <div class="testimonial-quote">
          The real-time insights are addictive. I catch myself checking Air360 like social media. <span
            class="highlight">Except this actually makes me money</span
          > instead of wasting my time!
        </div>
        <div class="testimonial-author">Grace Liu</div>
        <div class="testimonial-company">Performance Marketer at ROI Masters</div>
      </div>

      <div class="testimonial">
        <div class="testimonial-quote">
          Air360 turned our quarterly "let's improve the website" meetings into weekly optimization
          sprints. <span class="highlight">We ship better UX faster than ever</span>. Users are
          happier, we're more productive.
        </div>
        <div class="testimonial-author">Daniel Reed</div>
        <div class="testimonial-company">Product Owner at SprintTeam</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .container {
    /* max-width: 1200px; */
    /* margin: 0 auto; */
  }

  .header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 80px;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
    margin-top: 150px;
  }

  .header-intro {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #555;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .header h1 {
    font-size: 48px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    margin: 40px 0;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .testimonials-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 40px 50px;
    margin-top: 60px;
  }

  .testimonial {
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 0;
    padding: 0;
    margin-bottom: 50px;
  }

  .testimonial-quote {
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .highlight {
    background-color: #f176bd;
    color: white;
    padding: 0.1em 0.2em;
  }

  .testimonial-author {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #f0a6ca;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  }

  .testimonial-company {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: #666;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  /* Mobile responsiveness */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .testimonials-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 35px 40px;
    }

    .header h1 {
      font-size: 36px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .testimonials-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
    }

    .header h1 {
      font-size: 28px;
    }

    .testimonial-quote {
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    body {
      padding: 40px 20px;
    }
  }
</style>
